L341: 
L342: which can be written explicitly as
L343:  | $$\Delta t\leq\frac{\delta}{L_{f}+g(t)^{2}L_{s}+\left|\gamma_{t}\right|L_{\varphi}+\left|\beta_{t}\right|L_{\varphi}}$$  |
